<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50318" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vĕhes</span></b> , is, f.
		veho, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a carriage loaded</i> with any thing, <i>a
				cart-load</i>, <i>wagon-load</i> (post-Aug.).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">faeni large onusta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					36, 15, 24, § 108</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">stercoris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					11, 2, 86</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fimi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					18, 23, 53, § 193</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">qui lapis etiam nunc ostenditur magnitudine
					vehis,</span>”
				<i>so big as to be a cart-load</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id. 2,
					58, 59, § 149</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, as a measure, <i>a
				load</i>, <i><span class="en">Col. 11, 2, 13</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
